+# Homepage media
+
+- `hero.mp4`: [Latte art](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/latte-art-810/), Mixkit.
+- `roasting.mp4`: [Coffee roaster in operation](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/coffee-roaster-in-operation-88001/), Mixkit.
+- Both clips are provided under the [Mixkit Stock Video Free License](https://mixkit.co/license/#videoFree). Local copies are resized to 960 pixels wide, encoded as H.264 without audio, and optimized for progressive playback. Poster JPEGs are extracted from the corresponding stock footage.
+- The podcast is streamed from the publisher's public enclosure URL, with attribution and a link to the original episode. It is not copied into this repository.
+
+Below-the-fold media URLs and posters must remain in `data-src` / `data-poster` attributes in the initial HTML. `media-loader.js` activates them within 200 pixels of the viewport, or on keyboard/pointer intent. Do not add media preloads, poster preloads, CSS backgrounds, or eager duplicate images for these assets.
